name: One approved context question through native accounting and answer recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_question.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 acknowledge the partial Map | pending-context
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-context
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/question-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | question-plan
expect: One question job
keys: G
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+S use text | question-editor
keys: End
paste-file: @ART/question-edit.txt
require-live-snap: 20 Keep uncertainty explicit | edited-question
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | saved-question
keys: t
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | calls
keys: C-a
type: 2
keys: Enter r
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | review-reserve
keys: C-a
type: 1
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Plan digest | frozen-question
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_question.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
expect: Frozen question
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Open approved question job | approved
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | question-jobs
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_question.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r a
require-live-snap: 25 Read question answer | completed-question
expect: 1 committed / 2 total
expect: 1 protected review
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | answer
expect: Labeled synthetic answer
ask: Does approval freeze one question, context and model with separate spending consent and start, retaining a protected Review request?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | answer-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | answer-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | answer-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | answer-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | answer-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: answer-page-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Model: | answer-receipt-40x12
ask: Can the operator read the answer and its context, source and model through compact paging without an implied finding verdict or new work?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | answer-back-plan
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 a context result | answer-back-jobs
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | question-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 a context result | recovered-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 Read question answer | recovered-plan
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT ANSWER | recovered-answer
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_question.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover the same completed question and accounting without another request, while keeping context unchanged?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | recovered-back-plan
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 a context result | recovered-back-jobs
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
